step 32 "look 2.statue"
out rambler "The statue represents the Great God Mota, holding a staff.  He has long, grey\n\rhair and beard and a kindly look on his face.  His staff is topped by a painted\n\rcube, the 6 faces of which represent the 6 aspects of his power.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 105mv> \xff\xf9"
rng 51896 5ed8996e
